Data attribution
----------------

Input-output tables distributed with this repository are derived from Eurostat
dataset `naio_10_cp1700` (Symmetric input-output table at basic prices, 64x64
industries, EU27_2020), (c) European Union, reused under the Eurostat open data
policy (Commission Decision 2011/833/EU, CC-BY 4.0). The sector aggregation
64 -> 20 and all derived vectors are our own work and are released under the MIT
licence above. See data/metadata/manifest.json for the exact retrieval record.
